{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5c69cc2559f13fc9","name":"Service Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-5c69cc2559f13fc9","title":"Service Droid","revision":21109,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:10:42Z","sha256":"991f024e32ec1248843b36d4a7f9d1fc09036356190e8e3808dfe269c6f3246a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21109","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Service%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5c69cc2559f13fc9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Service Droids have the following Chassis Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Service Droids receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},". Service Droids are adept at recognizing the needs of their owners and adapting to them.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Like other Droids, Service Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Service Droids are typically of Medium size, gaining no bonuses or penalties for their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Service Droids have a base speed of 6 squares and use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Service Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["3rd-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/3rd-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:75702a16c64c3380"}," and have all Droid immunities and typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Service Droids are constructed with the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed in each:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," Appendages and 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mount","referenceId":"reference:45d4e22b431825b6"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulator","referenceId":"reference:a28880d579fbd223"}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Feat:"]}," To supplement its translation and etiquette duties, a Service Droid can select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Perception)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Perception)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Knowledge (Bureaucracy))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Knowledge_(Bureaucracy))"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore))"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},". A Service Droid can take only one of these bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Service Droids can speak, read, and write both Basic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
